# Next.js apps (`candidate`, `recruiter`)

- Use the **App Router** (`app/`)
- Do **not** add new Route Handlers for business API — call Nest instead
- Use `@numee/shared` `ApiCall` (or shared HTTP helpers) for API requests
- In dev, **proxy `/api` → Nest** (`localhost:3001`) via `next.config` rewrites so cookies stay same-origin
- Leave `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` empty when using the proxy; set it only for explicit cross-origin
- Session cookies are portal-scoped: candidate `numee_candidate_session`, recruiter `numee_recruiter_session` — read via each app’s `lib/auth/sessionCookie` helper, never the legacy `session` name

## Recruiter (`apps/recruiter`)

- UI must use `@numee/shared` components and `@numee/shared/styles/tokens.css` — no ad-hoc hex colors/fonts in new UI (use CSS variables / token theme classes)
- Recruiter business APIs live under `/api/recruiter/*` on Nest; do not add Next Route Handlers for them
